---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import GridLines from '../components/GridLines.astro';
---
<Base side="law" page="privacy" title="Privacy · Hakan Alemdar" description="How this website handles personal data.">
  <section class="page-head">
    <GridLines />
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="kicker">Datenschutzerklärung</div>
      <h1 class="display">Privacy</h1>
      <p>This is a personal website. It sets no cookies, runs no analytics or tracking, and loads nothing from third-party servers.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="wrap sec-tight legal">
    <h2>Who is responsible</h2>
    <p>Hakan Alemdar, Frankfurt am Main, Germany. Email: <a href="mailto:hakan99alemdar@gmail.com">hakan99alemdar@gmail.com</a>.</p>

    <h2>Hosting</h2>
    <p>The site is served by Cloudflare, Inc. (101 Townsend St, San Francisco, CA 94107, USA). To deliver pages and protect the site against attacks, Cloudflare necessarily processes technical data from your request, such as your IP address, the time of the request, the page requested and your browser’s user agent. I do not receive or store this data myself. The legal basis is my legitimate interest in running a secure, working website (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR). Cloudflare is certified under the EU–U.S. Data Privacy Framework, and transfers to the US rely on that adequacy decision (Art. 45 GDPR). Details are in <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">Cloudflare’s privacy policy</a>.</p>

    <h2>Fonts and images</h2>
    <p>Fonts and images are stored on this site’s own server. Your browser does not contact Google Fonts or any other external service when you read these pages.</p>

    <h2>Email</h2>
    <p>If you email me, I use your address and message only to reply and to handle your request. The legal basis is Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR where the message concerns a possible engagement or job, and Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR otherwise. I delete the correspondence once it is no longer needed, unless a legal retention duty applies. My email is provided by Google.</p>

    <h2>External links</h2>
    <p>Links to LinkedIn, Kickstarter, BackerKit and other sites take you to those services, which have their own privacy policies. Nothing is sent to them until you click.</p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>You have the right to access, rectification, erasure, restriction of processing, data portability and to object to processing based on legitimate interests (Art. 15–21 GDPR). To use them, email me. You may also complain to a data protection supervisory authority, for example the Hessian Commissioner for Data Protection and Freedom of Information (HBDI).</p>

    <p><small>Last updated: October 2026</small></p>
  </section>
  <section class="wrap contact">
    <footer class="foot">
      <a href="/law">Law &amp; Tech</a>
      <a href="/games">Games</a>
      <span>© 2026 Hakan Alemdar</span>
    </footer>
  </section>
</Base>
